嗯，你找楠木吗？
我就是。{be01}
啊！那就是我向得文的
兹伏奇社长订购的部件吧？{be01}
非常感谢！
这样我们就能开始为勘探做准备了。

I am Team Aqua’s Archie.{be01}
Tell me, why do you meddle in the
noble affairs of Team Aqua?{be01}
Pokémon, people, all life depends on
the sea.{be01}
So, Team Aqua is dedicated to the
expansion of the sea.{be01}
Don’t you agree? What we are doing
is a magnificent undertaking.{be01}
Ah, fine...
You’re still too young.{be01}
It can’t be helped that you do not
understand our ideals.{be01}
But, if you ever oppose us again,
there will be consequences!{be01}
Heed my warning!
Farewell!

Capt. Stern: You’re...
Ah, okay, you’re {0100:0}...{be01}
Anyway, that was a tense situation!
Thank you for saving us!{be01}
Oh, yes, I almost forgot that you
even brought the parts from Devon!

楠木馆长：糟糕！
没时间耽搁了！{be01}
我们得赶快开始
我们的海底勘探了。{be01}
再次谢谢你，
不过我得先失陪了！{be01}
随便参观一下
我们的展品吧。
